<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Wind Tempos (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859261"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="1:22.681"><div begin="1:08.927" end="1:22.681"><p begin="1:08.927" end="1:13.150" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:08.927" end="1:09.027">This</span> <span begin="1:09.027" end="1:09.267">next</span> <span begin="1:09.267" end="1:09.693">song</span> <span begin="1:11.029" end="1:11.614">is</span> <span begin="1:11.867" end="1:12.147">for</span> <span begin="1:12.147" end="1:12.470">the love</span> <span begin="1:12.470" end="1:12.591">of</span> <span begin="1:12.591" end="1:12.703">my</span> <span begin="1:12.703" end="1:13.150">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">接下来这首歌 献给我的此生挚爱</span></p><p begin="1:13.526" end="1:22.681" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:13.526" end="1:14.036">And</span> <span begin="1:15.534" end="1:15.636">per</span><span begin="1:15.636" end="1:15.904">son</span> <span begin="1:15.904" end="1:16.746">who</span> <span begin="1:16.746" end="1:16.844">real</span><span begin="1:16.844" end="1:17.014">ly</span> <span begin="1:17.014" end="1:17.195">tru</span><span begin="1:17.195" end="1:17.369">ly</span> <span begin="1:17.369" end="1:17.559">save</span> <span begin="1:17.559" end="1:17.967">me</span> <span begin="1:17.967" end="1:18.317">and</span> <span begin="1:19.564" end="1:20.037">helped</span> <span begin="1:20.634" end="1:20.749">this</span> <span begin="1:20.749" end="1:20.906">al</span><span begin="1:20.906" end="1:21.109">bum</span> <span begin="1:21.109" end="1:21.403">ac</span><span begin="1:21.403" end="1:21.584">tual</span><span begin="1:21.584" end="1:21.712">ly</span> <span begin="1:21.712" end="1:21.801">come</span> <span begin="1:21.801" end="1:21.864">in</span><span begin="1:21.864" end="1:22.044">to</span> <span begin="1:22.044" end="1:22.144">e</span><span begin="1:22.144" end="1:22.278">xis</span><span begin="1:22.278" end="1:22.681">tence</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也是她真正意义上拯救了我的灵魂 并给予我帮助 使得这张专辑得以问世</span></p></div></body></tt>